### Create Country
POST {{host}}/location/country
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "name": "Sudanese",
  "iso3Code": "SUA"
}

### Create State
POST {{host}}/location/state
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{employer_token}}

{
  "name": "Kassala",
  "countryId": "55d6f7cb-b44d-41a3-8527-4a8ab85b6329"
}

### Get all faculties
GET {{host}}/faculty
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get single faculty
GET {{host}}/faculty/d7dcc83c-62a2-40e9-8e1b-44ec8b0e9f6b
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create Department
POST {{host}}/department
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "name": "Geography",
  "facultyId": "d7dcc83c-62a2-40e9-8e1b-44ec8b0e9f6b"
}

### Get all departments
GET {{host}}/department
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get single department
GET {{host}}/department/da7f571d-6bb0-4d0f-b239-59fbc7900829
Authorization: {{token}}
